.15);\"><b>Huit, neuf, dix</b><span style=\"opacity:.7;\"> · Eight, nine, ten</span></li><li style=\"padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);\"><b>Un, deux, trois, quatre, cinq, six, sept, huit, neuf, dix</b><span style=\"opacity:.7;\"> · One to ten</span></li></ul>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234564,"_nanoseconds":376000000}},{"id":"E0EtWiEY6YR0aW1hAyAc","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":6,"part":3,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l06-p03-b1","partTitle":"Say it 1/3","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Six, sept</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">Six, seven</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Six, sept","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234564,"_nanoseconds":342000000}},{"id":"ZsU0d1EvTzqDT5lA1GaR","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":6,"part":4,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l06-p04-b1","partTitle":"Say it 2/3","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Huit, neuf, dix</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">Eight, nine, ten</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Huit, neuf, dix","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234564,"_nanoseconds":454000000}},{"id":"c9p2OVIu35X8l4xypG1P","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":6,"part":5,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l06-p05-b1","partTitle":"Say it 3/3","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Un, deux, trois, quatre, cinq, six, sept, huit, neuf, dix</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">One to ten</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Un, deux, trois, quatre, cinq, six, sept, huit, neuf, dix","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234564,"_nanoseconds":489000000}},{"id":"LZPw7MnUNIrJQDCXLcLl","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":6,"part":6,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l06-p06-b1","partTitle":"Listen to the conversation","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"opacity:.8;\">Read and listen to the whole conversation first. You play the “You” part next.</p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Bonjour ! Ça va ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Hello! How are you?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Ça va bien ! Et toi ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I'm good! And you?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Très bien. Regarde mes cartes !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Very good. Look at my cards!</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Combien ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">How many?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Compte !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Count!</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Six, sept, huit !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Six, seven, eight!</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Et après ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">And then?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Neuf, dix !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Nine, ten!</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Dix cartes jaunes !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Ten yellow cards!</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Bravo !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Well done!</span></p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234564,"_nanoseconds":772000000}},{"id":"4dpjAphMeJziYyOOtlKC","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":6,"part":7,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l06-p07-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 1/5","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Bonjour ! Ça va ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Hello! How are you?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Ça va bien ! Et toi ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I'm good! And you?</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Ça va bien ! Et toi ?","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234564,"_nanoseconds":797000000}},{"id":"k6lPhnJtNn8f0Qo9Ow1a","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":6,"part":8,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l06-p08-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 2/5","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Très bien. Regarde mes cartes !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Very good. Look at my cards!</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Combien ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">How many?</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Combien ?","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234564,"_nanoseconds":869000000}},{"id":"5HE5qlCR1lpeLX3eHmeI","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":6,"part":9,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l06-p09-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 3/5","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p 